            {
                "entry_id": "69ff4acb-d391-3669-9e98-f4b01552b0fc",
                "word": "trifold",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "b84beacf-0853-49e1-9b1b-b2072df3c11f",
                        "entry_id": "69ff4acb-d391-3669-9e98-f4b01552b0fc",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "trifolds"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7450e643-17ea-31d5-81d8-bbadad592721",
                        "entry_id": "69ff4acb-d391-3669-9e98-f4b01552b0fc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Any sheet of paper or cardboard, folded into three sections along two parallel creases and used to present information, typically as a brochure or display board."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1afbb837-69a2-4518-9400-f0855b3a7b2e",
                                "sense_id": "7450e643-17ea-31d5-81d8-bbadad592721",
                                "text": "Are saddlestitched double-fold brochures more effective than simple trifolds?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6fcf0aff-430a-49fc-a0df-0c68b992f408",
                                "sense_id": "7450e643-17ea-31d5-81d8-bbadad592721",
                                "text": "Before moving on to other aspects of story writing, have students create Character-Plot-Setting trifolds with ready-to-use tips on developing these three vital story elements."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "be41cb17-da04-4d4d-a1b3-8136cd0f855a",
                                "sense_id": "7450e643-17ea-31d5-81d8-bbadad592721",
                                "text": "That is, there is no pressure on parents to create high-end trifolds. Every student who puts in the effort gets to shine."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "66c293a2-929b-4660-9e64-0a6d73d20517",
                                "sense_id": "7450e643-17ea-31d5-81d8-bbadad592721",
                                "text": "How does a trifold help student organize thinking so communication is clearer?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b438219f-70aa-4ed0-ae53-b6c43291aa26",
                                "sense_id": "7450e643-17ea-31d5-81d8-bbadad592721",
                                "text": "Cards, bifolds and trifolds with information on public finances, debt, municipal finances, and other economic issues."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b4e66bd6-824d-37df-ba6b-bf59e6f20528",
                        "entry_id": "69ff4acb-d391-3669-9e98-f4b01552b0fc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A wallet with three equal-sized sections that fold together."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dd24dfb1-6bff-495a-b032-e4e6eaa0b93f",
                                "sense_id": "b4e66bd6-824d-37df-ba6b-bf59e6f20528",
                                "text": "Trifolds and credit card hip wallets have been interchangeably in the second slot for several seasons, and this Christmas it appeared that trifold sales edged ahead by a nose."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9db7c09e-cdd2-416d-9d2c-ecbd3a10078d",
                                "sense_id": "b4e66bd6-824d-37df-ba6b-bf59e6f20528",
                                "text": "A Dante spokesman estimated about 10 percent of the increase was attributable to higher prices. Best selling items were flatfolds and trifolds."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c8c4974e-c741-4da4-a370-d5a3e5893aec",
                                "sense_id": "b4e66bd6-824d-37df-ba6b-bf59e6f20528",
                                "text": "A 1996 survey showed that men under age 20 buy three times as many trifolds as bifolds. So a trifold wallet becomes a habit, even after it has expanded to the size and shape of a jumbo bar of soap."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f5e99b6f-833f-3370-b9eb-eb50814798f4",
                        "entry_id": "69ff4acb-d391-3669-9e98-f4b01552b0fc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Anything folded into thirds to resemble a trifold."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c3842b07-fa88-4e41-871d-bd3568b5965b",
                                "sense_id": "f5e99b6f-833f-3370-b9eb-eb50814798f4",
                                "text": "Three plywood portable trifolds covered with burlap were assembled with hinges to divide the room at the pleasure of the displayers."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2ae07cd5-6c15-4807-ba69-9f2e7f87afc9",
                                "sense_id": "f5e99b6f-833f-3370-b9eb-eb50814798f4",
                                "text": "Panoramic cards (two cards, folded) and trifolds (three cards) were occasionally issued in the Photochrome series and are rare finds today."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "16ec7eaa-f3e6-415a-947f-15726423994e",
                                "sense_id": "f5e99b6f-833f-3370-b9eb-eb50814798f4",
                                "text": "For handsanding detail areas, fold sandpaper quarters into trifolds."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "06d014f6-7735-4e46-a517-5324cef174cb",
                                "sense_id": "f5e99b6f-833f-3370-b9eb-eb50814798f4",
                                "text": "Holding strictly to the highest classical French standards, Grand Marque® Pate Feuilletee is made with 6 trifolds, yielding 1459 alternating layers of dough and Plugra® butter."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1bb0c294-35dc-4d73-befb-d4dcd396d58d",
                                "sense_id": "f5e99b6f-833f-3370-b9eb-eb50814798f4",
                                "text": "I close the door behind me and let the tears ride down my cheeks as I make trifolds of underwear, sheets and towels."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "38d10e2d-649e-44a5-b59f-94a659642d56",
                                "sense_id": "f5e99b6f-833f-3370-b9eb-eb50814798f4",
                                "text": "There was a steel napkin dispenser, the napkins themselves those little trifolds that manage to be both flimsy and sturdy at the same time, which seems impossible, but is not."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
